            (2 * np.sin(t) - np.sin(2 * t)) * 0.5,
            0
        ])

    @beat("Draw the base cardioid and bubbles", seconds=4, narration="Yet again, asking a question where we tweak a parameter for one of these functions yields this iconic cardioid and bubbles shape.")
